<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Relief for us smelly bards.  LOL &nbsp;(Read 685 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=835" title="View the profile of Keyes">Keyes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 6<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=835"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1308.msg12945#msg12945"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1308.msg12945#msg12945">Relief for us smelly bards.  LOL</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> December 06, 2004, 12:28:54 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well, SoE Devs are saying they&#039;re aware of the boredom of song twisting (hmm never thought of twisting as boring more like painfully necesry to play a bard well).&nbsp; So, they are playing with a new auto casting system called &quot;melody&quot; on the Test Server.&nbsp; I&#039;ll probably try it but doubt it will work better than the manual twist we bards use now.&nbsp; I know I in most groups I&#039;m constantly changing the dynamics of my song twisting to fit the mobs being pulled (casters and melee require different song sets).&nbsp; Bards have to be adaptable to allow them to handle the unseen roamer, or someone breaking mez, or going LD or healer running LOM.<br /><br />Have any of you RN bards tired it (Melody) out on Test?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12946"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=879" title="View the profile of Yslane">Yslane</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 9<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.radiophile.net/ferretava.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								In time you will fear the awesome power of ferrets<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Yssiebabo&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Yssiebabo" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=879"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.echoesineternity.org" title="Echoes In Eternity" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:yslane@echoesineternity.org"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1308.msg12946#msg12946"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1308.msg12946#msg12946">Re: Relief for us smelly bards.  LOL</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> December 06, 2004, 02:12:25 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/melody is the worst idea ever.&nbsp; Granted, I&#039;m a cleric - but I&#039;ve enjoyed my bard twinks immensely.&nbsp; It takes a lot of skill to play a good bard - /melody will end up being a crutch.&nbsp; <br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/lame.gif" alt="lame" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />[70 Prelate] Yslane (High Elf) &lt;Echoes in Eternity&gt;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12948"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
