							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I agree about EQ being too easy now. When I first started playing they still had hell levels, lol. I&#039;ve only played for 3 years, but the game went from being a challenge to being too easy. I miss the old EQ, except the part where pallies sucked :P
